# OCCTBIM Windows Installer

This is a placeholder for the Windows installer executable.

File: OCCTBIM-Setup-v1.3.0.exe
Size: ~150MB
Platform: Windows 10/11 (64-bit)

To build the actual installer, you would need:
- NSIS (Nullsoft Scriptable Install System) or Inno Setup
- Compiled OCCTBIM binaries
- Dependencies (Qt, OpenCASCADE, etc.)
- Installation scripts

Contact: contact@occtbim.com for source code and build instructions.